--- BUOC 5: RA SOAT VA KIEM THU GIAN LAN TREN PROJECTCORE ---
Kiem tra cac ca negative test tren ProjectCore:
  1. Ca sai nguoi (NotArbiter / NotParty): Chi dinh dung vai tro, ke la bi chan -> DAT
  2. Ca sai thoi diem (DeadlineNotReached / DeadlinePassed): Rut som hoac khieu nai muon bi chan -> DAT
  3. Ca sai so tien (WrongAmount): Nap khong dung gia price niem yet bi chan -> DAT
  4. Ca tan cong tai nhap: ProjectCore doi trang thai Completed/Refunded truoc khi chuyen tien
     va su dung modifier nonReentrant -> BAT KHAT XAM PHAM (Reentrancy Proof).

